id: pm-ts-starter-project-references
title: Support TypeScript project references in SDK bound checks (regenerate referenced declarations per bound)
description: Follow-up to pm-ts-starter-min-sdk-drift and PR 154. Project references are deliberately refused until every bound can regenerate declarations without changing consumer inputs and every referenced root retains compiler-owned package isolation.
type: Feature
status: open
priority: 3
tags: []
