author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: A warm current-SDK inferred declaration exposing currentOnly must yield TS2339 after a forced minimum rebuild; warm and cold matrices must agree.; A nested foreign SDK reached by relative import and added as a referenced config must never bypass package identity isolation.; Traverse every reference node with cycle protection; regenerate outputs separately per bound; preserve all consumer files and retain typed refusal until exact support exists.
